      "content": "Here's the ordered queue ahead for the GA and SC. The resolution at vote and the proposal on deck have TEP's tentative voting stance.\n\nGA:\n\n#[PASSED] GA - Repeal \"End Collective Punishment\" \n\n#[PASSED] GA - Repeal \"Sustainable Fishing Act\" \n\n3. #[AT VOTE - AGAINST] GA - Repeal \"Freedom of Information Act\" \n\n4. #[NEXT] GA - Protecting Wartime Internees \n\n5. #GA - On Basic Education \n\n6. #GA - Repeal \"A Decriminalization Of Suicide\"\n\n[All repeals from now on are in #Final Ride Repeals ]\n\n7.  Repeal \"Tariffs and Trade Convention\"\n\n8. Repeal “Access to Basic Banking and Lending\"\n\n9. Repeal: “Traditional Medicine”\n\n10. Repeal: “Promoting Natural Sciences in Schools”\n\n11. Repeal: “Responsible Land Management”\n\n12. Repeal: “The Civil Charter of the World Assembly”\n\n13. Repeal: “Access to Life-Saving Drugs”\n\n14. Repeal: “Privacy Protection Act”\n\n15. Repeal: “The Right to a Lawful Divorce”\n\n16. Repeal: “Nuclear Testing Protocol”\n\n17. Repeal: “Combating International Piracy”\n\n18. Repeal: “Religious Freedom Protection”\n\n19. Repeal: “Freedom to Read and Learn”\n\n20. Repeal: “No Penalty Without Law”\n\n21. #GA - Property Rights in Extraterrestrial Space \n\nSC:\n\n:neko_sleep:",
